# 容器内运行的脚本必须保持 LF：CRLF 会让 proot 容器里的 bash/python 报错（上游 issue #45）
* text=auto
*.sh text eol=lf
*.py text eol=lf
*.yml text eol=lf
*.yaml text eol=lf
*.json text eol=lf
*.md text eol=lf
*.java text eol=lf
*.kt text eol=lf
*.kts text eol=lf
*.gradle text eol=lf
*.properties text eol=lf
*.xml text eol=lf
*.aidl text eol=lf
